        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(b) For the purpose of computing consecutive days of a sickness absence, the first day of such absence will start at the time within the Employee's Scheduled Daily and Weekly Tour when he or she is first absent due to sickness disability and shall continue for a period of twenty-four (24) consecutive hours thereafter. Subsequent consecutive days of such absence will start and end at the same times on the days following within the Employee's Scheduled Weekly Tour.",
